/.envrc
/.worktrees/
# Local cargo settings. The tree carries none: a committed
# `rustc-wrapper` or `linker` silently overrides whatever a contributor
# has configured for themselves, and a workaround for one machine's
# toolchain is not this project's build policy. The dev shell in
# `flake.nix` clears all three through the environment instead, which
# wins over these keys wherever the build runs.
/.cargo/config.toml
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
